    "detailed_description": "<u>BURST WITCH</u> is a bullet hell game with the classic scrolling shooter gameplay.<br>Control different Witches to fight all kinds of enemies and enjoy the most exciting bullet hell experience with a wealth of ammo types and epic music!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010\u2160\u3011Customize Ammo Combination Freely</h2>Wider attack range, better penetration, homing bullets\u2026 a wealth of options to build your own ammo combination.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010\u2161\u3011Gothic Art Style</h2>Beautiful character portraits and 3D battle scenes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010\u2162\u3011Incredible Original Music</h2>Symphonic and jazz music delivers an immersive fighting experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/bfd447c22822e1d69f1f2b4417146188.poster.avif?t=1658477754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/bfd447c22822e1d69f1f2b4417146188.webm?t=1658477754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/bfd447c22822e1d69f1f2b4417146188.mp4?t=1658477754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/08e61a24dbceae6b9a78a3d24e0ff23d.poster.avif?t=1658477754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/08e61a24dbceae6b9a78a3d24e0ff23d.webm?t=1658477754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/08e61a24dbceae6b9a78a3d24e0ff23d.mp4?t=1658477754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<u>BURST WITCH</u> is a bullet hell game with the classic scrolling shooter gameplay.<br>Control different Witches to fight all kinds of enemies and enjoy the most exciting bullet hell experience with a wealth of ammo types and epic music!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010\u2160\u3011Customize Ammo Combination Freely</h2>Wider attack range, better penetration, homing bullets\u2026 a wealth of options to build your own ammo combination.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010\u2161\u3011Gothic Art Style</h2>Beautiful character portraits and 3D battle scenes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u3010\u2162\u3011Incredible Original Music</h2>Symphonic and jazz music delivers an immersive fighting experience.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/bfd447c22822e1d69f1f2b4417146188.poster.avif?t=1658477754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/bfd447c22822e1d69f1f2b4417146188.webm?t=1658477754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/bfd447c22822e1d69f1f2b4417146188.mp4?t=1658477754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/08e61a24dbceae6b9a78a3d24e0ff23d.poster.avif?t=1658477754\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/08e61a24dbceae6b9a78a3d24e0ff23d.webm?t=1658477754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2001670/extras/08e61a24dbceae6b9a78a3d24e0ff23d.mp4?t=1658477754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
